# Incridea working images (CLEANUP-PLAN Decision 6): only the files the
# case study actually links to should ever be committed. Everything else in
# this directory is working material (raw screenshots, certificate scans,
# social carousels) that stays local. A new file dropped here is untracked
# by default; wire it into work/incridea-2022-branding.html, then add its
# exact name to the allowlist below before `git add`-ing it.
